# Package names (ERE, anchored) whose derivations CI may push to the public
# Cachix cache. The script requires a `-<digit>` version after the name, which
# keeps out unversioned config glue (worktrunk-config, emacs-configured, …).
# Free software only: the cache is public, so anything unfree or
# vendor-redistributed must never match here.

# niri: built from the host's pkgs (nixpkgs-wayland overlay), so niri's own cache misses
niri-unstable
niri-scratchpad

# DankMaterialShell stack
dms-[A-Za-z-]+
quickshell(-wrapped)?
pinentry-dms

# Local packages and tool inputs
openwiki
opencode(-desktop)?
worktrunk
tuicr
jj-starship
mempalace
mcp-hub
discordo

# nixpkgs packages our overlays shift off cache.nixos.org
python3\.[0-9]+-[A-Za-z0-9_-]+
flameshot
meld
gtksourceview
composer

# Editor plugins
emacs-[A-Za-z0-9-]+
vimplugin-[A-Za-z0-9.-]+
